Because that's my opinion.  It's an exploitation of the inventory
management system.  Frankly, your character shouldn't even know that
random gems are being cursed, but the player needs to be told because of
how the UI works.  There's no way to hide that information.  Of course,
most of us do things all the time that our characters wouldn't know to
do in-game, but this case just happens to be where I draw the line.  

