I don't necessarily think it's ok.  I mentioned it as being almost as
bad as #naming gems.  I clearly think it's unacceptable from a strict
roleplaying standpoint in most cases.  However, I also think that a
character who's pissed at his/her god or is more interested in gaining
power than remaining loyal would certainly at least consider using a
HoOA, especially if it's been a tough trip up.  

Still, it's questionable, which is why before I did it, I asked here
whether it was considered abusive.  The responses were in the negative,
so that was fine with me.  

